{"2648050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sam & Max: The Devil's Playhouse", "steam_appid": 2648050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3162640], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An ancient, terrible power lies waiting…</h2>Max has always been the more unhinged member of the Freelance Police—a lovable lunatic with a knack for spreading chaos wherever he goes. But recently his abilities have taken a supernatural turn.<br><br>It all started when he stumbled upon a mysterious toy that allows him to glimpse the future. Now Sam &amp; Max have aroused the attention of a host of villains from across the galaxy who are hellbent on acquiring the magical Toys of Power to achieve their own ends.<br><br>As those who seek the Devil’s Toybox close in and Max’s psychic abilities grow beyond his control, the Freelance Police will come up against their most frightening adversary yet: the power of Max’s mind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648050/extras/0b54f9018188c8cd319fc319d622dea3.avif?t=1728164417\" width=596 height=248 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>A bizarre paranormal adventure:</strong> Explore odd locales, meet eccentric characters, and solve brain-tickling puzzles in an interactive story with a surprise around every corner.<br></li><li> <strong>Rabbity-thing mind meld:</strong> Jump into Max’s brain and use the Toys of Power to see the future, teleport, read minds, and other tricks.<br></li><li> <strong>No walkthrough required:</strong> The game detects when you’re stuck and provides subtle hints.<br></li><li> <strong>Beautifully remastered:</strong> Lighting, lip-sync, cinematography, music, and more have been updated and enhanced to bring Telltale’s 2010 episodic season up to modern standards.<br></li><li> <strong>Last in a trilogy:</strong> See the episodic Sam &amp; Max series through to its epic conclusion.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An ancient, terrible power lies waiting…</h2>Max has always been the more unhinged member of the Freelance Police—a lovable lunatic with a knack for spreading chaos wherever he goes. But recently his abilities have taken a supernatural turn.<br><br>It all started when he stumbled upon a mysterious toy that allows him to glimpse the future. Now Sam &amp; Max have aroused the attention of a host of villains from across the galaxy who are hellbent on acquiring the magical Toys of Power to achieve their own ends.<br><br>As those who seek the Devil’s Toybox close in and Max’s psychic abilities grow beyond his control, the Freelance Police will come up against their most frightening adversary yet: the power of Max’s mind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648050/extras/0b54f9018188c8cd319fc319d622dea3.avif?t=1728164417\" width=596 height=248 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>A bizarre paranormal adventure:</strong> Explore odd locales, meet eccentric characters, and solve brain-tickling puzzles in an interactive story with a surprise around every corner.<br></li><li> <strong>Rabbity-thing mind meld:</strong> Jump into Max’s brain and use the Toys of Power to see the future, teleport, read minds, and other tricks.<br></li><li> <strong>No walkthrough required:</strong> The game detects when you’re stuck and provides subtle hints.<br></li><li> <strong>Beautifully remastered:</strong> Lighting, lip-sync, cinematography, music, and more have been updated and enhanced to bring Telltale’s 2010 episodic season up to modern standards.<br></li><li> <strong>Last in a trilogy:</strong> See the episodic Sam &amp; Max series through to its epic conclusion.</li></ul>", "short_description": "The last game in the episodic Sam &amp; Max trilog